{{#> layout}}
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;color:#1E2A3E;">You already have an account</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Someone (hopefully you) just tried to sign up for {{brandName}} with this email address. There is already an account for it.</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0;text-align:center;"><a href="{{loginUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background-color:#F7C600;color:#1B1B1B;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid #8F6F00;">Go to sign in</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Forgot your password? No problem, you can choose a new one here: <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="color:#1F6FB8;">Reset password</a>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Was this not you? Then you do not need to do anything. Your account stays as it is.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#566179;word-break:break-all;">Button not working? Copy this link into your browser:<br><a href="{{loginUrl}}" style="color:#1F6FB8;">{{loginUrl}}</a></p>
{{/layout}}
